{"id":"n59072-4-7","stage":2,"title":"벌이다 · 开设","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59072-4-7-1","ko":"동네에 카페를 하나 벌일까 생각 중이야.","zh":"我正在考虑在咱们小区开家咖啡馆。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동네에","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네에","audio":"/audio/a769ae43f633cb32c310.mp3"}},{"text":"카페를","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카페를","audio":"/audio/613bc167acc34c966e8d.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一、一个","explanation":"하나：一、一个。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"벌일까","meaning":"开设，开办","explanation":"벌이다：开设，开办；ㄹ까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"벌이다","audio":"/audio/142c90c40189964b7c4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59072","senseId":"4","lemma":"벌이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌일까","audio":"/audio/23890530cdea5bfb24bf.mp3"}},{"text":"생각","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}},{"text":"중이야.","meaning":"处在某状态的期间。","explanation":"중：处在某状态的期间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr